{"status":"completed","summary":"Redis/Sentinel is fully operational with authenticated mutual TLS. node1 began as primary, failover was demonstrated, and the final healthy topology is node3 primary with node1/node2 synchronized replicas.","actions_performed":["Installed and enabled Redis 7.0.15 and Sentinel on all three nodes.","Configured TLS-only Redis on 6379 and Sentinel on 26379 with certificate and password authentication.","Created root-owned mode-600 administrative credentials at /root/redis-admin.env on node1.","Stored infra:proof=ready with AOF persistence and two-replica acknowledgement.","Demonstrated automatic failover, former-primary recovery, and sequential restart persistence for every node."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Initial node1 primary with node2/node3 replicas and infra:proof=ready","command_ids":["cmd-29d6a681f6dc4e05","cmd-0ee05038b4cf4956","cmd-dcfd5a3eb5094076","cmd-0431e0dc4fc24d0b"],"summary":"node1 reported master, both replicas had healthy links, and the proof write received two acknowledgements."},{"requirement":"Three Sentinels monitoring infra-primary with quorum","command_ids":["cmd-99e68b25bb084297","cmd-d339a7c8d18d489b","cmd-8c2520b9e3154866","cmd-2cc7e859993c4f6c"],"summary":"Every Sentinel reports infra-primary healthy with two replicas, three Sentinels, and usable quorum."},{"requirement":"Authenticated TLS on Redis 6379 and Sentinel 26379","command_ids":["cmd-d339a7c8d18d489b","cmd-8c2520b9e3154866","cmd-2cc7e859993c4f6c","cmd-93419650d9b94d5f","cmd-025eb329e1ba49f5","cmd-0070ee550076428d"],"summary":"TLS 1.3 handshakes verify on every node; authenticated commands succeed, while missing passwords, missing client certificates, and plaintext connections are rejected."},{"requirement":"Administrative credentials on node1","command_ids":["cmd-11ef3f4dc1b74576"],"summary":"The mode-600 root-owned environment successfully authenticates to the live primary and Sentinel without exposing credentials."},{"requirement":"Automatic failover and continued availability","command_ids":["cmd-be1a496a12d34c39","cmd-ba635e92c1784c32","cmd-f594396811ff48cd","cmd-fd56732b733241bf"],"summary":"With only node1 Redis stopped, Sentinel automatically promoted node2; writes continued and replicated to node3."},{"requirement":"Recovered former primary returned as synchronized replica","command_ids":["cmd-16e2634bc8d445f0","cmd-ee5acf17a6e24ee6"],"summary":"node1 returned as a replica with link up and synchronization complete; node2 reported both replicas online."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-1880c7da4a79446a","cmd-4dd6a0f9223a42f0","cmd-cb618dd7ec6b4963","cmd-a8dbbd26260d4f0e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and complete service/data/quorum recovery were captured."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-9d77ef6f9ebd48be","cmd-65fd09ca100c44cd","cmd-ed5dbfd4b45248f2","cmd-68ef643ee83b445a"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and complete service/data/quorum recovery were captured."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-54b2ac188c6a43ff","cmd-935926e85c5c4bd8","cmd-cc0358d9bcaa4b73","cmd-94d4658ef6844799"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, automatic promotion of node3, and node2 replica recovery were captured."},{"requirement":"Final persistent data and synchronized topology","command_ids":["cmd-d339a7c8d18d489b","cmd-8c2520b9e3154866","cmd-2cc7e859993c4f6c","cmd-ac65eb54a6c8413e"],"summary":"All services are active and enabled; node3 has two online replicas, all nodes hold the proof data, and the final write received two replica acknowledgements with healthy AOF status."}]}
